<title>SRI LANKA: Vanik shares up 4 pct in retail buying.</title>
<headline>Vanik shares up 4 pct in retail buying.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vanik Inc Ltd shares rose four percent, or 50 cents, to 13 rupees in early Tuesday trading boosted by small retail investors buying, brokers said.</p>
<p>&quot;Retailers have been buying cheap liquid stocks with good growth fundamentals, in the plantation, manufacturing and finance sectors,&quot; said a local broker.</p>
<p>Analysts said Vanik Inc, an investment bank, is expected to report good third quarter results.</p>
<p>--Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
